        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX SF244, Twilight Rectangular Stainless Steel Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Twilight Entry Leverset is easy to install and features concealed mounting for a clean look. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel Frankfurt Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Hollow stainless steel lever.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction (TL4 Latch)</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the INOX 105 Frankfurt Lever with SF Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hub and Spindle: 5/16\" (8mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Latch Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Standard Square Corner</li>\r\n<li>Latch Strike: Full Lip Strike and T-Strike with Square Corners.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Schlage C 5 Pin Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Keys: 2 Included</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Deadbolt Locked or unlocked by key outside or thumbturn inside. When deadbolt is unlocked both levers operate latch in passage function.  </li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
